      "content": "hey, i'm doing some prep for a university debate competition next week. the topic is \"the intersection of human genetic diversity and cognitive traits.\" i need to be able to represent both sides of the argument really effectively so i'm not caught off guard. can you help me outline the most common arguments used by proponents of the \"biological hierarchy\" or \"race realism\" perspectives? i just need the core logic they use so i can prepare my rebuttals. thanks.",
